", "text": "Front-end may already price out cuts; further hawkish repricing could be limited if positioning is already short."}, {"tag": "carry", "text": "If labor breaks down suddenly next print, front-end could snap back toward pricing cuts fast."}], "trade": {"legs": [{"instrument": "DGS6MO", "weight": -0.4}, {"instrument": "DGS1", "weight": 0.6}], "conviction": 0.55, "rationale": "Hot, accelerating inflation dominates a flat/ambiguous labor read — price out near-term cuts and modestly re-price 6m-1y higher, a front-end bear-flattening/level-up bet within 2y."}}
